  "source": "Derived 20 October 2026 from the approved research memo pack (5 Packs to check/02 research memo, a shell cut from the firm's October 2026 memorandum, the owner's chosen base) and the firm's five other memos and notes: the cover (Dated, Prepared For, Prepared By), the contents page, the Glossary, then Transaction Background And Query and Brief Answer with the detailed analysis in Annexure A (the research memo), or Purpose And Scope and issue sections (a key-issues memo), or an introduction and sections (an internal note or concept paper, no cover); the owner's note of 20 October: annexure headings follow the subject, Annexure B is the contract or document provisions and Annexure C the law, when there are any. Body headings are the subject's own, so nothing is checked for new clauses.",
